    "description": "## Outcome and context\n\nBUILD-211 (BA-10, WAGR-181) added the standard Chatter Activity Feed to the BA record page but didn't specify placement. Emily's feedback confirms it should sit at the bottom of the page, below the other BA sections.\n\n## Current state\n\nStandard Chatter is enabled on the BA object/page layout per BUILD-211; feed placement on the page was \"not confirmed in the transcript\" at the time and sourced from the prototype only.\n\n## Proposed solution\n\nReposition the Activity Feed component to the bottom of the BA record page, below the other Dynamic Forms/related-list sections.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n1. The Activity Feed is the last component on the BA record page.\n2. No other section's layout or visibility is affected by the move.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nDepends on BUILD-211 — Brand Ambassador: Activity Feed (WAGR-181).\n\n## Source\n\nWagertech Notes / Questions (Emily Vandenberg), reviewed Sep 2026: \"Move Activity Feed to the bottom.\" https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ShxHdE6kxblGnih7VQzXbBx1eL0sC6XAD-fk8H6V9yw/edit?tab=t.0",
